<section id="faq" class="iitj-white">
  <div class="padding-global padding-section-medium">
    <div class="container-large iitj-faqs-inner">
      <div class="iitj-faqs-head">
        <h2 class="iitj-heading-48 iitj-text-ink">FAQs</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="tab-slot">
        <div
          data-duration="0.2"
          data-loop-controls="false"
          data-tab-component-id=""
          data-slide-tabs="false"
          data-autoplay-duration=""
          data-preview-content="false"
          class="tab_wrap iitj-faq-wrap"
        >
          <div role="tablist" class="tab_button_list iitj-faq-tablist">
            <div data-tab-item-id="" class="iitj-faq_tab iitj-faq-link">
              <div class="text-color z-index-2">
                <div class="text-slot">
                  <div class="tab_button_text">Program Overview</div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div data-tab-item-id="" class="iitj-faq_tab iitj-faq-link">
              <div class="text-color z-index-2">
                <div class="text-slot">
                  <div class="tab_button_text">Eligibility and Admissions</div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div data-tab-item-id="" class="iitj-faq_tab iitj-faq-link">
              <div class="text-color z-index-2">
                <div class="text-slot">
                  <div class="tab_button_text">Fees</div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div data-tab-item-id="" class="iitj-faq_tab iitj-faq-link">
              <div class="text-color z-index-2">
                <div class="text-slot">
                  <div class="tab_button_text">Schedule and Format</div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div data-tab-item-id="" class="iitj-faq_tab iitj-faq-link">
              <div class="text-color z-index-2">
                <div class="text-slot">
                  <div class="tab_button_text">Learning and Projects</div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div data-tab-item-id="" class="iitj-faq_tab iitj-faq-link">
              <div class="text-color z-index-2">
                <div class="text-slot">
                  <div class="tab_button_text">
                    Certification, M.Tech. and Career
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="tab_content_wrap">
            <div class="tab_content_list">
              <div class="iitj-faq_list">
                <div class="accordion-list-slot">
                  <details class="iitj-faq_item iitj-faq-acc">
                    <summary class="iitj-faq_q">
                      <h3 class="iitj-faq_qtext">What is this program?</h3>
                      <div data-accordion="icon" class="iitj-faq_ic">
                        <div class="iitj-faq_chev"></div>
                      </div>
                    </summary>
                    <div class="iitj-faq_body">
                      <p class="text-size-medium iitj-text-grey iitj-faq_a">
                        A 12-month, live online PG Diploma from IIT Jodhpur that
                        brings AI/ML, Generative AI, and data science into data
                        engineering. Eligible graduates can progress to an
                        Executive M.Tech. in one more year.
                      </p>
                    </div>
                  </details>
                  <details class="iitj-faq_item iitj-faq-acc">
                    <summary class="iitj-faq_q">
                      <h3 class="iitj-faq_qtext">What will I learn?</h3>
                      <div data-accordion="icon" class="iitj-faq_ic">
                        <div class="iitj-faq_chev"></div>
                      </div>
                    </summary>
                    <div class="iitj-faq_body">
                      <p class="text-size-medium iitj-text-grey iitj-faq_a">
                        Four connected areas: AI-First Data Engineering,
                        Generative AI and LLM Applications, Agentic AI Systems,
                        and Cloud-Native AI Architecture.
                      </p>
                    </div>
                  </details>
                  <details class="iitj-faq_item iitj-faq-acc">
                    <summary class="iitj-faq_q">
                      <h3 class="iitj-faq_qtext">Is the program hands-on?</h3>
                      <div data-accordion="icon" class="iitj-faq_ic">
                        <div class="iitj-faq_chev"></div>
                      </div>
                    </summary>
                    <div class="iitj-faq_body">
                      <p class="text-size-medium iitj-text-grey iitj-faq_a">
                        Yes. You are assessed on what you build. Projects must
                        run, and your capstone is reviewed by IIT Jodhpur
                        faculty.
                      </p>
                    </div>
                  </details>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="iitj-faq_list">
                <div class="accordion-list-slot">
                  <details class="iitj-faq_item iitj-faq-acc iitj-faq_item iitj-faq-acc">
                    <summary class="iitj-faq_q iitj-faq_q">
                      <h3 class="iitj-faq_qtext">
                        Who is eligible for the PG Diploma?
                      </h3>
                      <div data-accordion="icon" class="iitj-faq_ic">
                        <div class="iitj-faq_chev"></div>
                      </div>
                    </summary>
                    <div class="iitj-faq_body">
                      <p class="text-size-medium iitj-text-grey iitj-faq_a">
                        A BTech, BSc + MSc, BCA + MCA, or STEM degree with a
                        minimum of 50% in UG or PG, and at least 1 year of work
                        experience after your qualifying degree.
                      </p>
                    </div>
                  </details>
                  <details class="iitj-faq_item iitj-faq-acc iitj-faq_item iitj-faq-acc">
                    <summary class="iitj-faq_q iitj-faq_q">
                      <h3 class="iitj-faq_qtext">
                        Who is eligible for the Executive M.Tech.?
                      </h3>
                      <div data-accordion="icon" class="iitj-faq_ic">
                        <div class="iitj-faq_chev"></div>
                      </div>
                    </summary>
                    <div class="iitj-faq_body">
                      <p class="text-size-medium iitj-text-grey iitj-faq_a">
                        A minimum of 60% in UG, First Division in UG or PG, and
                        2 years of work experience. In the PG Diploma, you need
                        75% attendance, no backlogs, a CGPA of 6.0 or above, 60%
                        aggregate marks, and the Program Director's
                        recommendation.
                      </p>
                    </div>
                  </details>
                  <details class="iitj-faq_item iitj-faq-acc iitj-faq_item iitj-faq-acc">
                    <summary class="iitj-faq_q iitj-faq_q">
                      <h3 class="iitj-faq_qtext">
                        Is there an admission test?
                      </h3>
                      <div data-accordion="icon" class="iitj-faq_ic">
                        <div class="iitj-faq_chev"></div>
                      </div>
                    </summary>
                    <div class="iitj-faq_body">
                      <p class="text-size-medium iitj-text-grey iitj-faq_a">
                        Yes. All PG Diploma applicants must qualify a
                        pre-screening test.
                      </p>
                    </div>
                  </details>
                  <details class="iitj-faq_item iitj-faq-acc iitj-faq_item iitj-faq-acc">
                    <summary class="iitj-faq_q iitj-faq_q">
                      <h3 class="iitj-faq_qtext">
                        What is the admission process?
                      </h3>
                      <div data-accordion="icon" class="iitj-faq_ic">
                        <div class="iitj-faq_chev"></div>
                      </div>
                    </summary>
                    <div class="iitj-faq_body">
                      <p class="text-size-medium iitj-text-grey iitj-faq_a">
                        Apply, take the pre-screening test, and pay the ₹10,000
                        application processing fee. You then receive your offer
                        letter from IIT Jodhpur, complete the payment, and
                        finish the Futurense Bridge Course.
                      </p>
                    </div>
                  </details>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="iitj-faq_list">
                <div class="accordion-list-slot">
                  <details class="iitj-faq_item iitj-faq-acc iitj-faq_item iitj-faq-acc">
                    <summary class="iitj-faq_q iitj-faq_q">
                      <h3 class="iitj-faq_qtext">What is the program fee?</h3>
                      <div data-accordion="icon" class="iitj-faq_ic">
                        <div class="iitj-faq_chev"></div>
                      </div>
                    </summary>
                    <div class="iitj-faq_body">
                      <p class="text-size-medium iitj-text-grey iitj-faq_a">
                        ₹3,55,000 for Year 1 (course fee ₹3,35,000 +
                        administrative fee ₹20,000). The Executive M.Tech. in
                        Year 2 costs ₹2,40,000.
                      </p>
                    </div>
                  </details>
                  <details class="iitj-faq_item iitj-faq-acc iitj-faq_item iitj-faq-acc">
                    <summary class="iitj-faq_q iitj-faq_q">
                      <h3 class="iitj-faq_qtext">
                        Is the application processing fee refundable?
                      </h3>
                      <div data-accordion="icon" class="iitj-faq_ic">
                        <div class="iitj-faq_chev"></div>
                      </div>
                    </summary>
                    <div class="iitj-faq_body">
                      <p class="text-size-medium iitj-text-grey iitj-faq_a">
                        It is fully refunded if IIT Jodhpur or Futurense does
