                        withdraw after acceptance.
                      </p>
                    </div>
                  </details>
                  <details class="iitj-faq_item iitj-faq-acc iitj-faq_item iitj-faq-acc">
                    <summary class="iitj-faq_q iitj-faq_q">
                      <h3 class="iitj-faq_qtext">Are EMI options available?</h3>
                      <div data-accordion="icon" class="iitj-faq_ic">
                        <div class="iitj-faq_chev"></div>
                      </div>
                    </summary>
                    <div class="iitj-faq_body">
                      <p class="text-size-medium iitj-text-grey iitj-faq_a">
                        Yes.
                      </p>
                    </div>
                  </details>
                  <details class="iitj-faq_item iitj-faq-acc iitj-faq_item iitj-faq-acc">
                    <summary class="iitj-faq_q iitj-faq_q">
                      <h3 class="iitj-faq_qtext">What is the refund policy?</h3>
                      <div data-accordion="icon" class="iitj-faq_ic">
                        <div class="iitj-faq_chev"></div>
                      </div>
                    </summary>
                    <div class="iitj-faq_body">
                      <p class="text-size-medium iitj-text-grey iitj-faq_a">
                        No refunds are given after the last date of
                        registration.
                      </p>
                    </div>
                  </details>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="iitj-faq_list">
                <div class="accordion-list-slot">
                  <details class="iitj-faq_item iitj-faq-acc iitj-faq_item iitj-faq-acc">
                    <summary class="iitj-faq_q iitj-faq_q">
                      <h3 class="iitj-faq_qtext">
                        When does the program start, and how long is it?
                      </h3>
                      <div data-accordion="icon" class="iitj-faq_ic">
                        <div class="iitj-faq_chev"></div>
                      </div>
                    </summary>
                    <div class="iitj-faq_body">
                      <p class="text-size-medium iitj-text-grey iitj-faq_a">
                        The PG Diploma starts in January 2027 (tentative) and
                        runs for 12 months across 2 semesters.
                      </p>
                    </div>
                  </details>
                  <details class="iitj-faq_item iitj-faq-acc iitj-faq_item iitj-faq-acc">
                    <summary class="iitj-faq_q iitj-faq_q">
                      <h3 class="iitj-faq_qtext">When are classes held?</h3>
                      <div data-accordion="icon" class="iitj-faq_ic">
                        <div class="iitj-faq_chev"></div>
                      </div>
                    </summary>
                    <div class="iitj-faq_body">
                      <p class="text-size-medium iitj-text-grey iitj-faq_a">
                        Live online on Friday late evenings, Saturdays, and
                        Sundays, with 10 to 15 live hours a week. The schedule
                        is set by IIT Jodhpur.
                      </p>
                    </div>
                  </details>
                  <details class="iitj-faq_item iitj-faq-acc iitj-faq_item iitj-faq-acc">
                    <summary class="iitj-faq_q iitj-faq_q">
                      <h3 class="iitj-faq_qtext">
                        What is the campus immersion?
                      </h3>
                      <div data-accordion="icon" class="iitj-faq_ic">
                        <div class="iitj-faq_chev"></div>
                      </div>
                    </summary>
                    <div class="iitj-faq_body">
                      <p class="text-size-medium iitj-text-grey iitj-faq_a">
                        A mandatory 5 to 7 day stay at IIT Jodhpur, where you
                        present your capstone, attend classes and labs, and work
                        with your cohort.
                      </p>
                    </div>
                  </details>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="iitj-faq_list">
                <div class="accordion-list-slot">
                  <details class="iitj-faq_item iitj-faq-acc iitj-faq_item iitj-faq-acc">
                    <summary class="iitj-faq_q iitj-faq_q">
                      <h3 class="iitj-faq_qtext">What will I build?</h3>
                      <div data-accordion="icon" class="iitj-faq_ic">
                        <div class="iitj-faq_chev"></div>
                      </div>
                    </summary>
                    <div class="iitj-faq_body">
                      <p class="text-size-medium iitj-text-grey iitj-faq_a">
                        Systems such as a multi-agent financial intelligence
                        system, a real-time sentiment engine for financial
                        markets, and an agentic data pipeline with automated
                        anomaly detection.
                      </p>
                    </div>
                  </details>
                  <details class="iitj-faq_item iitj-faq-acc iitj-faq_item iitj-faq-acc">
                    <summary class="iitj-faq_q iitj-faq_q">
                      <h3 class="iitj-faq_qtext">What tools will I use?</h3>
                      <div data-accordion="icon" class="iitj-faq_ic">
                        <div class="iitj-faq_chev"></div>
                      </div>
                    </summary>
                    <div class="iitj-faq_body">
                      <p class="text-size-medium iitj-text-grey iitj-faq_a">
                        Python, Apache Spark, Apache Kafka, Amazon SageMaker,
                        LangChain, LangGraph, Microsoft AutoGen, and more. Tools
                        may vary depending on the subjects finalized.
                      </p>
                    </div>
                  </details>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="iitj-faq_list">
                <div class="accordion-list-slot">
                  <details class="iitj-faq_item iitj-faq-acc iitj-faq_item iitj-faq-acc">
                    <summary class="iitj-faq_q iitj-faq_q">
                      <h3 class="iitj-faq_qtext">
                        What credential will I receive?
                      </h3>
                      <div data-accordion="icon" class="iitj-faq_ic">
                        <div class="iitj-faq_chev"></div>
                      </div>
                    </summary>
                    <div class="iitj-faq_body">
                      <p class="text-size-medium iitj-text-grey iitj-faq_a">
                        A PG Diploma in Data Engineering and Agentic AI from IIT
                        Jodhpur, earned through 30 credits. It is an academic
                        credential, not a certificate.
                      </p>
                    </div>
                  </details>
                  <details class="iitj-faq_item iitj-faq-acc iitj-faq_item iitj-faq-acc">
                    <summary class="iitj-faq_q iitj-faq_q">
                      <h3 class="iitj-faq_qtext">
                        How does the M.Tech. pathway work?
                      </h3>
                      <div data-accordion="icon" class="iitj-faq_ic">
                        <div class="iitj-faq_chev"></div>
                      </div>
                    </summary>
                    <div class="iitj-faq_body">
                      <p class="text-size-medium iitj-text-grey iitj-faq_a">
                        If you meet the progression requirements, your 30
                        credits transfer to the Executive M.Tech. You complete
                        34 more in Year 2, without the GATE exam. For queries,
                        write to office_eep@iitj.ac.in.
                      </p>
                    </div>
                  </details>
                  <details class="iitj-faq_item iitj-faq-acc iitj-faq_item iitj-faq-acc">
                    <summary class="iitj-faq_q iitj-faq_q">
                      <h3 class="iitj-faq_qtext">
                        Does the program guarantee a job?
                      </h3>
                      <div data-accordion="icon" class="iitj-faq_ic">
                        <div class="iitj-faq_chev"></div>
                      </div>
                    </summary>
                    <div class="iitj-faq_body">
                      <p class="text-size-medium iitj-text-grey iitj-faq_a">
                        No. Futurense does not guarantee placement or salary.
                        Career support includes resume building, mock
                        interviews, referrals, and the Futurense Job Board.
                      </p>
                    </div>
                  </details>
                  <details class="iitj-faq_item iitj-faq-acc iitj-faq_item iitj-faq-acc">
                    <summary class="iitj-faq_q iitj-faq_q">
                      <h3 class="iitj-faq_qtext">
                        Who do I contact for program queries?
                      </h3>
                      <div data-accordion="icon" class="iitj-faq_ic">
                        <div class="iitj-faq_chev"></div>
                      </div>
                    </summary>
                    <div class="iitj-faq_body">
                      <p class="text-size-medium iitj-text-grey iitj-faq_a">
                        Write to support@futurense.com.
                      </p>
                    </div>
                  </details>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="tab_control_wrap iitj-faq-controls">
            <div data-tab="previous" class="iitj-faq-arrowwrap">
              <button aria-label="Previous category" class="iitj-faq-arrow">
                <svg
                  width="16"
                  height="16"
                  viewBox="0 0 16 16"
                  fill="none"
                  aria-hidden="true"
                  style="display:block"
                >
                  <path
                    d="M10 3.5L5.5 8L10 12.5"
                    stroke="currentColor"
                    stroke-width="1.6"
                    stroke-linecap="round"
                    stroke-linejoin="round"
                  ></path>
                </svg>
              </button>
            </div>
            <div data-tab="next" class="iitj-faq-arrowwrap">
              <button aria-label="Next category" class="iitj-faq-arrow">
                <svg
                  width="16"
                  height="16"
                  viewBox="0 0 16 16"
                  fill="none"
                  aria-hidden="true"
                  style="display:block"
                >
                  <path
                    d="M6 3.5L10.5 8L6 12.5"
                    stroke="currentColor"
                    stroke-width="1.6"
                    stroke-linecap="round"
                    stroke-linejoin="round"
                  ></path>
                </svg>
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  // FAQ categories: one list of questions at a time, with previous/next arrows.
  // The first question starts open.
  document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>(".tab_wrap").forEach((wrap) => {
    const buttons = [
      ...wrap.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>(".tab_button_list > *"),
    ];
    const panels = [
      ...wrap.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>(".tab_content_list > *"),
    ];
    const prev = wrap.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>(
      "[data-tab='previous'] button",
    );
    const next = wrap.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>(
      "[data-tab='next'] button",
    );
    const list = wrap.querySelector<HTMLElement>(".tab_button_list")!;
    list.setAttribute("role", "tablist");
    let active = 0;
    const show = (index: number, focus = false) => {
      buttons.forEach((b, i) => {
        b.classList.toggle("is-active", i === index);
        b.setAttribute("aria-selected", String(i === index));
        b.tabIndex = i === index ? 0 : -1;
      });
      panels.forEach((p, i) => {
        p.classList.toggle("is-active", i === index);
        p.style.display = i === index ? "block" : "none";
      });
      if (focus) buttons[index].focus();
      if (index !== active)
        panels[index].animate([{ opacity: 0 }, { opacity: 1 }], {
          duration: 300,
          easing: "ease-out",
        });
      list.scrollTo({ left: buttons[index].offsetLeft, behavior: "smooth" });
      active = index;
    };
    const step = (d: number, focus = false) =>
      show((active + d + buttons.length) % buttons.length, focus);
    buttons.forEach((b, i) => {
      b.setAttribute("role", "tab");
      b.id = `faq-tab-${i + 1}`;
      b.setAttribute("aria-controls", `faq-panel-${i + 1}`);
      panels[i].id = `faq-panel-${i + 1}`;
      panels[i].setAttribute("role", "tabpanel");
      panels[i].setAttribute("aria-labelledby", b.id);
      b.addEventListener("click", () => show(i));
      b.addEventListener("keydown", (e) => {
        if (["ArrowRight", "ArrowDown"].includes(e.key)) step(1, true);
        else if (["ArrowLeft", "ArrowUp"].includes(e.key)) step(-1, true);
      });
    });
    prev?.addEventListener("click", () => step(-1));
    next?.addEventListener("click", () => step(1));
    show(0);
  });
  const first = document.querySelector<HTMLDetailsElement>(
    "#faq .tab_content_list details",
  );
  if (first) first.open = true;
</script>

<style is:global>
  @layer components {
    /* Until the script runs, show only the first FAQ category. */
    .tab_content_list > :not(:first-child) {
      display: none;
    }
    .container-large.iitj-faqs-inner {
      padding-left: 1.5rem;
      padding-right: 1.5rem;
    }
    .tab_button_list {
      z-index: 2;
      display: flex;
      overflow: auto clip;
    }
    .tab_button_list.iitj-faq-tablist {
      flex-direction: column;
      row-gap: 0.25rem;
      overflow: visible;
    }
    .tab_wrap {
      grid-column-gap: 2rem;
      grid-row-gap: 2rem;
      flex-flow: column;
      display: flex;
      position: relative;
    }
    .tab_wrap.iitj-faq-wrap {
      grid-template-columns: 22.75rem 1fr;
      align-items: start;
      gap: 2rem 4rem;
      display: grid;
    }
    .tab_content_list {
      grid-column-gap: 2rem;
      grid-row-gap: 2rem;
      flex-flow: column;
      display: flex;
      position: relative;
    }
    .tab_control_wrap {
      z-index: 1;
      grid-column-gap: clamp(
        0.625 * 1rem,
        (
          (0.625 - ((0.75 - 0.625) / (90 - 20) * 20)) * 1rem +
            ((0.75 - 0.625) / (90 - 20)) * 100vw
        ),
        0.75 * 1rem
      );
      grid-row-gap: clamp(
        0.625 * 1rem,
        (
          (0.625 - ((0.75 - 0.625) / (90 - 20) * 20)) * 1rem +
            ((0.75 - 0.625) / (90 - 20)) * 100vw
        ),
        0.75 * 1rem
      );
      flex-flow: row;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      width: 110%;
      margin-left: -5%;
      display: flex;
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0% 0% auto;
    }
    .tab_control_wrap.iitj-faq-controls {
      display: none;
    }
    .tab_content_wrap {
      overflow-x: clip;
    }
    .iitj-faq_tab {
      color: #5e606e;
